    "created_at": "2016-05-09T15:59:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-09T15:59:03Z",
    "body": "Based on what is about to happen with iframe in shadow DOM, yes. history.go() in sandbox iframe shouldn't affect the global session history state. So I assume history.go() should throw or be no-op inside sandbox,  or if we get the per-iframe session history defined for the shadow DOM case, perhaps sandbox could use the same.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
